<title>UK: SOCCER-EVERTON AGREE TERMS FOR KANCHELSKIS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EVERTON AGREE TERMS FOR KANCHELSKIS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>English premier league side Everton have agreed terms with Italy's Fiorentina for their unsettled Russian international Andrei Kanchelskis.</p>
<p>The Ukrainian-born winger scored 16 goals for Everton last season but has been openly unhappy at the English premier league club this season.</p>
<p>Everton manager Joe Royle said on Wednesday the move would go ahead when Kanchelskis agreed personal terms with the Serie A club.</p>
</text>
